{"parse": {"title": "Shop Counter (ore)", "pageid": 106068, "revid": 15267583, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Scenery\n|name = Shop Counter\n|image = [[File:Shop Counter (ore).png]]\n|release = [[1 June]] [[2017]]\n|update = The Inferno\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|location = [[Mor Ul Rek]]\n|options = Steal-from\n|examine = Lots of ore on here.\n|map = {{Map|x=2522|y=5075|mapID=23|mtype=pin|group=pinex}}\n|id = 30279\n|leagueRegion = Karamja\n}}\n'''Shop Counter''' is a unique stall found in inner [[Mor Ul Rek]]. The stall is owned by [[TzHaar-Hur-Rin]] as part of [[TzHaar-Hur-Rin's Ore and Gem Store]] and players can steal from it if they have a [[Thieving]] level of 82 or higher. A variety of ores can be stolen including: [[Iron ore|iron]], [[coal]], [[Silver ore|silver]], [[Gold ore|gold]], [[Mithril ore|mithril]], [[Adamantite ore|adamantite]], and [[Runite ore|runite]].\n\n==Thieving info==\n{{Thieving info\n|name = Shop Counter\n|level = 82\n|xp = 350\n|type = Stall\n|time = 30 seconds\n}}\n\nStealing from an ore stall is worth {{Coins|{{Average drop value|mob=\t\nShop Counter (ore)|raw=y}}}} on average.\n\n{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes}}{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1610261408142303233|date=3 January 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/103141|archivedate=14 January 2023}}\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Iron ore|quantity=1|rarity=25/80|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Coal|quantity=1|rarity=15/80|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Silver ore|quantity=1|rarity=10/80|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Gold ore|quantity=1|rarity=10/80|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mithril ore|quantity=1|rarity=10/80|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Adamantite ore|quantity=1|rarity=8/80|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Runite ore|quantity=1|rarity=2/80|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill\n|name=Rocky\n|quantity=1\n|skill=thieving\n|rarity=1/34,440\n|altrarity=1/34,015\n|altraritydash=yes\n|raritynotes=\n{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1620087552513548294|date=30 January 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/109359|archivedate=8 February 2023}}\n{{Refn|group=d| The drop rate increases with Thieving level; see [[Rocky#Drop_rates|Rocky]] page for more details.}}\n}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 8 May 2024\n|update = Project Rebalance: Skilling & Poll 81 MTA Changes\n|change = \n* The respawn timer for the stall has been reduced to 30 seconds.\n* The [[Thieving]] [[experience]] awarded for stealing from the stall has been increased from 180 to 350.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Stalls}}\n{{Mor Ul Rek}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:37.348014+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Iron_ore\" title=\"Iron ore\"><img alt=\"Iron ore.png: Shop Counter (ore) drops Iron ore with rarity 25/80 in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Iron_ore.png?9e4d4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"28\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Iron_ore\" title=\"Iron ore\">Iron ore</a></td><td data-sort-v